270 0 obj
  << /ActualText (YoungPhase is a modern streetwear fashion brand focused on bold aesthetics\054 youth culture\054 and premium visual identity\056 For this project\054 I was responsible for creating the complete brand identity including logo design\054 social media branding\054 promotional creatives\054 and digital visual direction\056 The goal was to build a stylish and recognizable fashion brand presence that connects with modern audiences through clean visuals and strong branding consistency\056)
